      "subtitle": "Folds to keychain size — opens into a full tote",
      "material": "Polyester fiber",
      "descriptionHtml": "<p>Polyester canvas, a keychain-sized fold, and a full shopping bag's worth of capacity the moment you shake it open. Built for the errand you didn't plan for — the extra grocery run, the gift that needs carrying, the gym bag that overflowed.</p>\n<p>Reinforced seams and a durable weave mean this is a bag meant to be unfolded and refolded hundreds of times, not a disposable liner. Dual handles are sized for a comfortable grip by hand or over a shoulder, and it folds back down small enough to clip to a keyring, bag strap, or belt loop.</p>\n<p>Available in Black, Brown, Wine Red, Army Green, Green, and Khaki — every colorway is the same reinforced build underneath. Ships as one tote bag per order.</p>",
